      "text": "Crumb, a tin hearth with a sulking loaf in it, is the only suitor who is also breakfast.",
      "mark": "cringing",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "who": "frost",
      "name": "Crumb",
      "text": "Tilly has been ending this conversation for eleven minutes. Tilly. I'm a toaster. Even I stop.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "who": "tilly",
      "name": "Tilly",
      "text": "Sir Quill, I've transcribed you twice tonight and you still haven't told me what you're calling about.",
      "mark": "cringing",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 8,
      "who": "quill",
      "name": "Sir Quill",
      "text": "I have prepared an ode of four hundred lines. Do not skip. Please. Line one.",
      "mark": "cringing",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 2,
      "round": 3
    },
    {
      "seq": 9,
      "who": "frost",
      "name": "Crumb",
      "text": "Score me out of ten. Careful. Mine only go to six. Above that is a fire.",
      "mark": "cringing",
